---
import PaperSignalLayout from '../../../layouts/PaperSignalLayout.astro';
---
<PaperSignalLayout title="Paper & Signal — design exploration" description="A development-only visual direction prototype for goutamprusty.com.">
  <section class="ps-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="ps-hero-copy">
      <p class="ps-eyebrow">Independent work · Research · Ideas</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Curiosity, made <em>useful.</em></h1>
      <p class="ps-lede">A home for research, writing and practical experiments. Explore the questions, the work, and the thinking that connects them.</p>
      <p class="ps-identity"><span class="ps-placeholder">Development placeholder · Professional descriptor</span><br />Replace with an owner-approved description of the work.</p>
      <div class="ps-actions"><a class="ps-button" href="#selected-work">Explore selected work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="ps-text-link" href="/design-exploration/paper-signal/research/">Read research <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ps-art" role="img" aria-label="Abstract composition of an arch, circle, half circle and ring in peach, lime and blue">
      <div class="art-arch"></div><div class="art-circle"></div><div class="art-half"></div><div class="art-ring"></div>
      <span class="ps-art-label" aria-hidden="true">PAPER / SIGNAL 01</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ps-section" id="selected-work" aria-labelledby="selected-title">
    <div class="ps-section-head"><div><p class="ps-eyebrow">A few things to explore</p><h2 id="selected-title">Selected work</h2></div><a class="ps-text-link" href="/design-exploration/paper-signal/project/">Open case study ↗</a></div>
    <div class="ps-project-grid">
      <a class="ps-project-card" href="/design-exploration/paper-signal/project/">
        <span class="ps-card-mark" aria-hidden="true">01</span><p class="ps-kicker">Project · Development sample</p><h3>Building a system around a question</h3><p>Placeholder project summary. Replace with a verified description of the problem, approach and evidence.</p><span class="ps-card-foot"><span>Project detail</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="ps-project-card" href="/design-exploration/paper-signal/research/">
        <span class="ps-card-mark" aria-hidden="true">02</span><p class="ps-kicker">Research · Development sample</p><h3>Following an idea through the evidence</h3><p>Placeholder research summary. The article prototype shows how long-form work can feel focused and readable.</p><span class="ps-card-foot"><span>Research article</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="ps-shelf-note">Two featured samples are shown as a considered static layout; no carousel or JavaScript is required.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="ps-section ps-discovery" id="topics" aria-label="Research, writing and interests">
    <div><p class="ps-eyebrow">Keep following a thread</p><h2>Research &amp; writing</h2><p class="ps-muted">Long-form ideas get room to breathe, with clear routes into connected work.</p><a class="ps-text-link" href="/design-exploration/paper-signal/research/">Read the article sample ↗</a></div>
    <div><p class="ps-eyebrow">Current interests · placeholders</p><ul class="ps-link-list"><li><a href="/design-exploration/paper-signal/research/">How ideas become useful tools <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li><li><a href="/design-exploration/paper-signal/project/">From question to working prototype <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li></ul><div class="ps-topic-row" aria-label="Example topics"><span class="ps-topic">Systems thinking</span><span class="ps-topic">Research methods</span><span class="ps-topic">Practical experiments</span></div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="ps-section" aria-labelledby="about-title"><p class="ps-eyebrow">A note about this place</p><h2 id="about-title">Work worth understanding.</h2><p class="ps-lede">This site brings together projects, research and writing so visitors can follow not only what was made, but how the thinking developed.</p><p class="ps-placeholder">Development placeholder — replace with approved personal introduction.</p></section>

  <section class="ps-contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><div><p class="ps-eyebrow">Contact</p><h2 id="contact-title">Have a thoughtful question?</h2><p>Contact destination needs confirmation before this prototype is published.</p></div><a class="ps-button" href="/contact/">See contact page <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
</PaperSignalLayout>
